reak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段あまりお金を使うタイプじゃないから、生まれて初めて大きなお買い物をしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもは慎重型の自分にも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな行動力あったんやってびっくりしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで無事買えたわけですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢の国に入っても一生カメラだけ起動しなくて……(；；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに戦いながらも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スマホが起動するまでは私のデジカメで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思って起動させると、なぜかその瞬間だけぶっ壊れたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから茉莉さんのカメラで撮ろうってなったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茉莉さんのカメラも真っ暗で起動しなくなっていたり…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかうまくいかなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々ハプニングが多すぎてパニックになっちゃったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それすらも楽しくて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_c7662131bc3d23fdd3d29792/1.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あいす〜🍨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_c7662131bc3d23fdd3d29792/2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この茉莉さん、素敵"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ撮ったの妃那"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_c7662131bc3d23fdd3d29792/3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いけいけなふたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今思い返しても笑っちゃうような、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな一日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まであまり見たことのなかったパレードや期間限定のものも見れて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗ったことのない乗り物にも乗れて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_c7662131bc3d23fdd3d29792/4.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事、新しいスマホのカメラも起動して！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高に楽しかった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗り物の前で大はしゃぎする茉莉さんのお姿もスマホに残せたし、今でもよく見返しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、茉莉さんのソロ写真ばかり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシャパシャしていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今考えると全然自撮りなかったの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茉莉さんと合流する前に雨に降られたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"折りたたみ傘を買ったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、茉莉さんとお会いしてからは夜まで一回も傘を開くことはせず、とっても快適な時間でꕤ︎︎·͜·"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かと思いきや、解散して一人になった瞬間に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ雨に降られるっていう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茉莉さんパワー恐るべし、ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしたら遊んでいる間に自分は泣くかなぁって思ってたんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、寂しさとかよりも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その場で過ごす時間がとてつもなく楽しくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔が絶えませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ、帰り道は切なくて寂しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の気持ちと天気が同期してるなぁ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて思ったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に過ごしている時はあんなに楽しくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔でいっぱいだったのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人になった途端に寂しくなっちゃうんですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それくらい、私にとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特別で幸せなお出かけだったんだと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに楽しかったぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茉莉さん、素敵な時間をありがとうございました(  ´﹀` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_c7662131bc3d23fdd3d29792/5.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_c7662131bc3d23fdd3d29792/6.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また次は森本軍団でも遠出とかしてみたい気持ち！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"